  "notes": "{心|こころ}がける means to consciously try to do something or keep something in mind.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n- Pattern: 〜を{心|こころ}がける / 〜ことを{心|こころ}がける\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {心|こころ}がけている: making an ongoing effort, trying habitually\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜を{心|こころ}がける: to be mindful of ~\n- 〜ように{心|こころ}がける: to try to ~\n- 〜ことを{心|こころ}がける: to make an effort to ~\n\nEXAMPLES:\n- {健康|けんこう}を{心|こころ}がける (to be mindful of health)\n- バランスの{良|よ}い{食事|しょくじ}を{心|こころ}がける (to try to eat a balanced diet)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {気|き}をつける: to be careful, to pay attention\n- {努|つと}める: to strive, to make an effort",
